WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/features/system/components/status/AiUsageCard.tsx feeding the shared
  web/src/components/data-display/UsageCard.tsx primitive. The operator-grade per-call Helix (AI provider)
  spend + volume card built on the WithAudit per-call audit log:

    Gate (web wrapper AiUsageCard, ADR-015 §I4): `if (!settings) return null; if (ai_mode === undefined ||
      ai_mode === 'off') return null; return <AiUsageCardInner/>`. The WHOLE surface is withdrawn in off mode —
      no data-ai-feature marker enters the DOM. This is the special-case "__usage__" server meta-feature gate
      (gated only on ai_mode != 'off', no per-feature toggle).
    AiUsageCardInner:
      isLoading && !today          → <UsageCard emptyMessage="Loading Helix usage…" />
      !today || call_count === 0   → <UsageCard emptyMessage="No Helix calls yet — turn on a feature to start." />
      else                         → <UsageCard bands details topLists />
      bands   = [ Today: {call_count} calls / {error_count} error(s) / intent=errorIntent,
                  Tokens: {input+output} total / {input} in · {output} out,
                  Cost / latency: formatCurrency(microCentsToDollars(cost_micro_cents)) / {round(avg_latency_ms)} ms avg ]
      details = [ Avg latency {round(avg)} ms, Errors {error_count} (danger if >0),
                  Input tokens {input}, Output tokens {output} ]
      topLists= [ if byFeature: "By feature (7 days)" → top-5 by call_count desc {feature_id → count};
                  if recent:    "Recent calls"        → first-5 {summarizeRecentRow → ✓/✗} ]
  Hooks  : useAiUsageToday / useAiUsageByFeature / useAiUsageRecent(10) (TanStack @ INTERVALS.STANDARD),
           useFormatting (formatCurrency = `${symbol}${fmtNumber(amount, precision)}`), useSettings (ai_mode gate).
  Helpers (reproduced verbatim — arithmetic is the contract):
           fmtCount(n) = (n==null||!finite) ? "—" : fmtInt(n);
           microCentsToDollars(mc) = (mc==null||!finite) ? 0 : mc / 1_000_000;
           errorIntent = err>0 && calls>0 ? (err/calls >= 0.05 ? 'danger' : 'warn') : 'normal';
           formatRelativeTime = <60s "{s}s ago" · <1h "{m}m ago" · <1d "{h}h ago" · else "{d}d ago" · NaN ⇒ raw iso;
           summarizeRecentRow = "{feature_id} · {model} · {fmtInt(input+output)} tok · {relative}".
  i18n  : the web source is "anonymous" — it uses hardcoded English literals (no t() calls). Per the native
          no-English-literals rule every literal is promoted to a P1/S10 key (table "AiUsageCard").

