STATES (every non-gated one renders — no hidden surface)
  gated    → ai_mode off → the whole surface is withdrawn (EmptyView), reproducing web null (ADR-015 §I4). This is
             NOT a hidden section: when AI is on but data is empty, the empty state renders.
  loading  → skeleton band tiles + detail rows (web isLoading && !today).
  empty    → "No Helix calls yet — turn on a feature to start." with a friendly icon (web !today||call_count===0),
             never a blank box.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web falls through to empty on error).
  data     → 3 bands + 4 details + optional By-feature / Recent top-lists.
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known content; no auto-refresh.

